    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; &ldquo;our,&rdquo; &ldquo;the Company,&rdquo;
    &ldquo;OCG&rdquo;, or &ldquo;our company,&rdquo; are to the combined business of Oriental Culture Holding LTD, a Cayman Islands company,
    and its consolidated subsidiaries;</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

