    <TD STYLE="width: 88%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Securities and Exchange Commission registration fee</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 1%">&nbsp;</TD>
